(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/stripchart") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/computer:") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/period:") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/dataonly") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/samples:"))) AND ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\w32tm.exe")) OR (where(OriginalFileName = "w32time.dll"))))
